; compare_old.claims — the OLD contract's guarantee, the property `pol compare`
; judges against BOTH models. `live` means every reachable situation can still
; reach an F-situation: here, that the machine can always still reach `safe`.
; It HOLDS on compare_old.pol (the `restore` move rescues a broken machine) and
; FAILS on compare_new.pol (restore deleted -> broken is a trap), so compare
; reports `still-safe` LOST.

(property still-safe "the machine can always still reach safe"
  (live (is m.mode safe)))
